{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_012_04_h",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:3b8fdecd154f8f522be0741d62df2c440ede4b437ed761f20d5224ba590f156d",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_h:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:527560a1274173a29aa9d38f087a353dd2e313d08789075638c0b0146bf62f66",
      "text": "OK！就是那个姿势对吧☆\nStand up，Mr. 山下！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_h:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a082f6d0fc579f01278871bbe921eac1d8abaa52336b0fc01efb73acd274cea9",
      "text": "（…………那个，奇怪的姿势）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_h:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ef719b39a09f7d86ba71a63e971df89fe2aa8ae79a5434720e74d863cdb0ebc",
      "text": "（无论是硲先生还是类，都打算极度认真、\n极度欢闹地摆出来啊……哈哈）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_h:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7182c37dff3ae31fd0bdb871c9c3bd4d7ce88a054df845d74db2b1004a2ff07",
      "text": "这就是我们倾注在偶像上的热情！\n……舞田君、山下君，上吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_h:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:124af7dc95c2e0abd1e641d03df08de30c7d43e357ca522bca3f707113aefdf2",
      "text": "热情姿势！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_h:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:608d8ce06dab991bae82435c98447256c3a58ffc1a33717e3bb83e83bcbe036b",
      "text": "（……这样到底行不行得通，已经习惯消极的\n我并不知道。但是，这里面……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_h:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:372f6041f6efde7933a064d49f1219ceadc83711f87ef9996086eba9921bdf8c",
      "text": "（有硲先生那种不可思议的不屈精神。\n有类无论何时、任何事都能乐在其中的心态）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_h:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fabf9b770de71b67864fa751359376b098ed8694269ae7910ead29620e742a27",
      "text": "（再加上作为搭头、与我形象不符的一场赌博。\n凝聚了我们三个人的一切，凝聚了我们的过往）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_h:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85f3fcd69abe6a98ce2f53f8eea2ec2f2d95ad5d46704fbbed7f2b2ada755342",
      "text": "（所以……拜托了。\n哪怕是为了他们两个，也请顺利发展吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
